Program entry points: RISC OS crash report; console lists exit.

- RISC OS: call YsRiscOsInstallErrorReport() (ysce_public patch 04) first
  thing in the game (BeforeEverything) and the console server (main), so a
  data abort or RISC OS error writes "RISC OS error &...: ..." and a
  backtrace to stderr.
- Console server: when asked only for a list (-listairplane, -listfield,
  -liststartpos), exit after printing it instead of waiting in the console
  menu for a key. With the output redirected to a file the menu can't be
  seen, so the program looked hung. Not RISC OS specific.

For YSCE 231e711. See docs/PORTING-NOTES.md in riscos-ysflight.

